<title>USA: TABLE-Comdisco Inc Q3 June 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Comdisco Inc Q3 June 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months     %    Nine Months     %</p>
<p>			  Ended June 30,   +/-  Ended June 30,  +/-</p>
<p>			   1997     1996	    1997     1996</p>
<p>  TOTAL REVENUE	    712   592   20%   2,035  1,703   19%</p>
<p> Total costs &amp; expenses  657   545   21%   1,879  1,567   20%</p>
<p> Net earnings		 34    29   17%	97     84   15%</p>
<p> Net after pfd divs	 32    27   19%	91     78   17%</p>
<p> Net EPS		    0.40  0.34   18%    1.15   0.98   17%</p>
<p> Common shrs outstanding  79    80		79     80</p>
<p>	   (Dollars in millions except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 Revenue includes a gain of $25 million ($16 million after-tax, or $.30 per common share) after settlement of litigation.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 also includes a non-cash, non-operating charge of $25 million ($16 million after-tax, or $.30 per common share) as a one-time addition to the equipment valuation allowance.</p>
